SUMMARY:Project Lavish & Wellness Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Students in grades 3–8 are invited to explore the science behind hair and wellness during Project Lavish\, a hands-on STEM experience designed to build knowledge and confidence. \nThrough interactive activities and games\, participants will learn about hair care\, sensory science and healthy habits while connecting with other young people. Lunch will be provided. \nSaturday\, Oct. 24\nBright Side Opportunities Center\, 515 Hershey Ave.\, Lancaster \n\nGrades 3–5 | 10 a.m.–noon\nGrades 6–8 | Noon–2 p.m.\n\nRegistration is open through Monday\, Oct. 19: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSem_mR35_eq2q-iCQMnUolHtukoz8Vffhj9j2abydt5JWEwuQ/viewform  \nProject Lavish is supported by Bright Side Opportunities Center\, the School District of Lancaster\, The Mix and the Lancaster City Alumnae Chapter of Delta Sigma Theta Sorority\, Inc. \n  \n 
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/project-lavish-wellness-workshop/
LOCATION:PA
CATEGORIES:Elementary,Intermediate,Secondary
END:VEVENT
