SUMMARY:SDoL Math Fair
DESCRIPTION:School District of Lancaster students and families are invited to an evening of hands-on math fun at the SDoL Math Fair on Wednesday\, Oct. 28\, from 5:30-7 p.m. at Wickersham Elementary. \nHosted in partnership with Mathematics Educators at Millersville University\, the district-wide event is designed for students in K through 5th grade to explore math through interactive games and activities while building their skills and confidence. \nStudents can participate in a variety of math challenges and games throughout the evening\, with prizes available along the way. Siblings and friends are also welcome to join the fun. \nCome discover just how “MATHemagical” an evening of math can be!
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/sdol-math-fair/
LOCATION:Wickersham Elementary\, 401 North Reservoir Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Districtwide Events
END:VEVENT
